# VISIT ZAKHO
## The Ultimate Digital Destination & Travel Experience
### MASTER CREATIVE DIRECTION, UX ARCHITECTURE & DEVELOPMENT BRIEF

**Project:** Visit Zakho  
**Destination:** Zakho, Kurdistan Region, Iraq  
**Platform:** International tourism and destination discovery website  
**Language:** English only  
**Creative standard:** World-class luxury travel editorial meets innovative digital experience design.  
**Objective:** Build an extraordinary, fully functional tourism website that allows anyone anywhere in the world to discover Zakho, explore its attractions, understand its culture, plan a visit, and experience the city digitally before arriving.

